    "finding": "The prior generation-only post-accept refresh catch could replace a newer same-editor unsaved-draft status with a delayed refresh error.",
    "correction": "Separate save failure from committed-save list-refresh failure, and require generation, draft revision and field ownership before any late error or final success publication.",
